00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:03.356 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MARTIN FRANCOEUR, candidat, PLC

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:04.891 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Trois-Rivières, Qc

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:06.426 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On a la chance de faire

00:02:03.657 --> 00:02:07.928 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avancer Trois-Rivières puis d'un

00:02:05.192 --> 00:02:09.429 size:53% position:73% line:53%
autre côté, il y a un adversaire

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:10.964 size:53% position:73% line:53%
