00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:15.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Bonjour, vous allez bien ?

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:17.070 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:18.271 size:53% position:73% line:53%
