00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pas trop loin derrière

00:02:18.572 --> 00:02:21.942 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le peloton de tête,

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.943 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Adis Smidzija, arrivé

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:23.977 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au Canada en tant que réfugié

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.978 size:53% position:73% line:53%
