00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:28.048 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ADIS SIMIDZIJA, candidat, NPD

00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:29.082 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Trois-Rivières, Qc

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:30.116 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je la rappelle toujours,

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:31.118 size:53% position:73% line:53%
